{title: Nosso General}
{artist: Morada}
{tempo: 130}
{time: 4/4}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#m7]Pelo Senhor marchamos sim
FOR THE LORD WE MARCH, YES
[D7M]O Seu exército poderoso é
HIS ARMY IS POWERFUL
[Bm7]Sua glória será vista em toda a [C#m7]terra[F#m7]
HIS GLORY WILL BE SEEN THROUGHOUT ALL THE EARTH
[F#m7]Vamos cantar o canto da vitória
LET US SING THE SONG OF VICTORY
[D7M]Glória a Deus, vencemos a batalha
GLORY TO GOD, WE HAVE WON THE BATTLE
[Bm7]Toda arma contra nós perecerá[C#m7][F#m7]
EVERY WEAPON FORMED AGAINST US WILL PERISH

{c: Chorus}
[D]O nosso general é Cristo[E]
OUR GENERAL IS CHRIST
[D]Seguimos os Seus passos[E]
WE FOLLOW HIS FOOTSTEPS
[D]Nenhum inimigo nos resistirá[E][B7]
NO ENEMY WILL STAND AGAINST US

{c: Verse 2}
[F#m7]Com o Messias marchamos sim
WITH THE MESSIAH WE MARCH, YES
[D9]em Suas mãos a chave da vitória
IN HIS HANDS IS THE KEY TO VICTORY
[Bm7]Que nos leva a possuir a terra[C#m7]
THAT LEADS US TO POSSESS THE LAND
[F#m7]prometida
PROMISED
[F#m7]Vamos cantar o canto da vitória
LET US SING THE SONG OF VICTORY
[D7M]Glória a Deus vencemos a batalha
GLORY TO GOD WE HAVE WON THE BATTLE
[Bm7]Toda arma contra nós perecerá[C#m7][F#m7]
EVERY WEAPON FORMED AGAINST US WILL PERISH

{c: Chorus (repeat)}
